{"id":"34aba96812e204dc","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-klingenberg.md","title":"Klingenberg Quarter-Pinching Hypothesis","display":"df-klingenberg — Klingenberg Quarter-Pinching Hypothesis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-klingenberg","aliases":["58-df-klingenberg"],"display":"df-klingenberg — Klingenberg Quarter-Pinching Hypothesis","depends_on":["[[58-df-manifold]]","[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-klingenberg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-klingenberg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-klingenberg — Klingenberg Quarter-Pinching Hypothesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"58-df-manifold\">58-df-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-klingenberg-—-Klingenberg's-Theorem\">df-klingenberg — Klingenberg's Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\tau,g,\\Pi,\\operatorname{sec},n,c\\in V\">\\(M,\\tau,g,\\Pi,\\operatorname{sec},n,c\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"58-df-manifold\">58-df-manifold</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\">\\(\\Pi\\)</span> is the specified carrier of tangent <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span>-planes and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{sec},\\Pi,\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{sec},\\Pi,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> gives their sectional curvatures.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KlingenbergQuarterPinched}_S(M,\\tau,g,\\Pi,\\operatorname{sec},n)\">\\(\\mathrm{KlingenbergQuarterPinched}_S(M,\\tau,g,\\Pi,\\operatorname{sec},n)\\)</span> (predicate defined here).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}klingenberg} \\vdash \\mathrm{KlingenbergQuarterPinched}_S(M,\\tau,g,\\Pi,\\operatorname{sec},n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{sec},\\Pi,\\mathbb R)\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Pi\\;\\left(\\frac14c&lt;\\operatorname{sec}(\\sigma)\\leq c\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}klingenberg} \\vdash \\mathrm{KlingenbergQuarterPinched}_S(M,\\tau,g,\\Pi,\\operatorname{sec},n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{sec},\\Pi,\\mathbb R)\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Pi\\;\\left(\\frac14c&lt;\\operatorname{sec}(\\sigma)\\leq c\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom defines only the sourced Riemannian quarter-pinching condition. Completeness, simple connectivity, and sphere consequences belong in theorem atoms with separately defined predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-klingenberg-—-Klingenberg's-Theorem","text":"df-klingenberg — Klingenberg's Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)$ and $\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)$ (see [[58-df-manifold]] and [[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]).","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)$ and $\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)$ (see [[58-df-manifold]] and [[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\tau,g,\\Pi,\\operatorname{sec},n,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau,n)